  "findings": {
    "identity": "ST&I BSc, fulltime180EC, primarilyDutch/partEnglish, September2026entry, High-techDesignerMaterials first official public-order neutral tie-break. Current public programme order retained independently of UCR fit; alternate API dropdown ordering not a new route selection.",
    "reuse": "Current adopted STI B SHA dc617ee08afd8ad4ffff95f7be0261310d2f0d7f2543c1568e90ba580d3f24ae, FacultyA6c05ca29ada58b9612588e9180d5714923c432a3a0b74e254875be9727cf1bd1, board27d6513b0919829f2f3a5582878a26fde5630493e867cb8b6f5f84caa64b53b8 and programme41184/41185/41188 responses match prior actual bodies exactly. Preserve prescribed membership, weights, projects/open-space and valid research. Fresh SSRHTML course body receipts are distinguished from earlierJSON receipts; no false byte-identity assertion.",
    "controllingRules": "Adopted15Sep2026 B4.3 lists ten individual materials units54EC, including QuantumPhysics6EC; one sharedDesignProject6EC makes secondyear60. Firstyear60, thirdyear30open+12AdvancedEthicalPrototyping+18BachelorProject total180. Do not add54track credits to its children or sum three mutually exclusive tracks. Specialisation footnote restricts units to registered trackstudents, but does not expressly waive the sharedQuantum enrolment clause. FacultyA4.1.6 still requires individualcourse conditions. Board precedence over conflicting Boardrules is not an explicit courseaccess waiver.",
    "access": "Current59384 Ingangseisen still restricts course to (bijvak)PhysicsAstronomy and BetaGammaPhysicsmajor. Its separate recommended-knowledge paragraph contemplates otherbackgrounds with optics/math; neither that recommendation nor ambiguous bijvak terminology establishes automatic ST&I materials enrolment. Registered STI-specialisation membership is necessary but not shown sufficient under both published conditions. Do not infer allSTIstudents excluded either.",
    "officialAlternative": "Programme-selected public STI OER index still links sameB/currentA/change/boardrules with no applicable correction. Current programme-specific registration expressly requires checking individual entryconditions and offers an individual exemption request at leasttwo weeks before registration opens; this is a request, not an awarded cohort exception. Placementpriority/capacity algorithm does not discharge access conditions. Targeted official-site search found no applicable Quantum/STI clarification. No login, petition, contact, livebrowser or registration action.",
    "academicContent": "Read25 actual current required-course entries, including disputedQuantum. Firstyear includes appliedmath/computing, chemical/cellularlife, mechanics, waves/optics, energy and practicalmakerspace skills. Materials54EC contains genuine condensedmatter, electronics/photonics labs, continuum mechanics, statisticalthermodynamics/materials, opticalinstrumentation and quantum/energyphysics, not generic environmentalchemistry alone. AIforScience uses scientificML/molecule/material representations; ConnectingDigitalWorld is databases/clientserver/JavaScript, not merely generaldataanalysis.",
    "projectsAndProgression": "B4.7 makes safetyinstruction compulsory before practical participation. AdvancedEthicalPrototyping12EC is fulltime8week physicalprototype/teamwork/ethicaldesign with measurement,demonstration,presentation and partlyindividualdefence; not a standalone ethics lecture. BachelorProject18EC is individualsupervisedresearch/thesis/presentation, at leasttwoUvAexaminers and permissionfor externalprojects. Both require fullfirstyear+120ECincludingDesignProject; deviation requires explicitapproval. ThirtyopenEC have overlap/approval/max12introductory/priorforeignminor rules. These are retained and added to plainreader notes."
  },
